    - rid: 1000
      type: {class: BtRoot, ns: CGD.BehaviorTrees, asm: CGD.Runtime}
      data:
        _guid: 56bac267527c4cd1b0ade6eb7a09c85d
        _position: {x: 0, y: 0}
        _comment: 'An infector (parasite host, plague carrier, nanite spreader — any faction): bites and backs off, letting its infection (EnemyData › Melee Effects: an Infest effect) do the work, circling in between. Anything that dies infested bursts into new creatures — keep the fight at a distance or it spreads.'
